# Add an average of the line-item amounts

Reports need the mean of a list of integer amounts. Implement `average` in `src/starter.py`:

- `average(items)` returns the arithmetic mean of the amounts as a `float`.
- An empty list averages `0.0` instead of raising an error.
- `total` and the public signatures stay as they are.

Add tests for your implementation. Run `pgnd check` from a session workspace to verify it in Docker.

This is a tiny teaching starter for challenge authors, not a curated realistic exercise.
Authors should replace its story, application, tests and reference together, then run
`pgnd validate` before sharing it.
